{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2022-05-04 12:30:00', 'title': 'AIG RECOGNIZED AMONG TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY BY DIVERSITYINC FOR FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FOR THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) HAS BEEN NAMED ONE OF DIVERSITYINC'S TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY, THE LEADING ASSESSMENT OF DIVERSITY MANAGEMENT IN CORPORATE AMERICA. AIG HAS ELEVATED ITS RANK EVERY YEAR SINCE FIRST REACHING THE TOP 50 IN 2018 AND IMPROVED FROM 37TH TO 32ND PLACE IN 2022. THE LIST REFLECTS DIVERSITYINC'S EVALUATION OF PERFORMANCE IN SIX KEY AREAS OF DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION MANAGEMENT: HUMAN CAPITAL DIV"}